# ── Release signing — NEVER commit these ─────────────────────────────
# The release keystore is the only thing that cannot be regenerated:
# losing it makes every existing install un-updatable, and committing it
# would let anyone sign updates for the app. Back it up offline.
android/keystore.properties
android/*.keystore
android/*.jks
